### ===================================================================
### KOLEKSI HTTP REQUEST — BACKEND 2 (AI ENGINE KELOMPOK ADIL)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api/ai
### Kontrak: { "data": { ... } } atau { "error": { "code", "message" } }
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/ai
@groupId1 = group-1
@groupId2 = group-2
@roomId2 = room-2

### 0. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR A: CHAT FASILITATOR BERSAMA KELOMPOK
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1.1 Kirim Pesan Bebas ke AI Asisten
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-dafano
x-role: STUDENT

{
  "message": "Halo AI, apa langkah awal terbaik untuk memulai proyek ini bareng teman-teman?",
  "senderName": "Dafano",
  "action": "chat"
}

### 1.2 Ambil Riwayat Chat Kelompok (Polling / Refresh Frontend)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/messages

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR B: CARI IDE TOPIK & SUDUT PANDANG UNIK
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2.1 Minta 3 Ide Sudut Pandang Unik
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-dafano
x-role: STUDENT

{
  "message": "Kasih ide topik presentasi yang menarik tentang Kerajaan Singasari dong! 🏛️",
  "senderName": "Dafano",
  "action": "ideas"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR C: USULAN PEMBAGIAN PERAN ADIL & TERAPKAN KE KANBAN
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3.1 Usulkan Pembagian Peran (Otomatis Normalisasi Total 100%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/split-roles
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-nadya
x-role: STUDENT

{
  "topic": "Strategi Diplomasi Ekspedisi Pamalayu Kertanegara",
  "deadline": "2026-11-20T23:59:00+07:00",
  "notes": "Fokus pada naskah primer dan peta jalur laut"
}

### 3.2 Terapkan Usulan ke Kanban Otomatis (Ganti :suggestionId sesuai respon di atas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/suggestions/sug-example/apply
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.3 Tolak / Dismiss Usulan
POST {{baseUrl}}/suggestions/sug-example/dismiss
Content-Type: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR D & E: REKOMENDASI PENANGGUNG JAWAB & ESTIMASI BOBOT
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4.1 Tambah Tugas Baru — Dapatkan Rekomendasi Beban Terendah
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/recommend-assignee
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-dafano
x-role: STUDENT

{
  "title": "Desain Slide Presentasi Canva",
  "description": "Menyusun 10 slide interaktif dan ringkasan materi wicara"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR F: VALIDASI BUKTI & CEK KELENGKAPAN BAB
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.1 Validasi Bukti Tugas Siswa (Badge ✦ AI Valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/task-1/validate
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-dafano
x-role: STUDENT

{
  "evidenceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1example-dafano"
}

### 5.2 Cek Kelengkapan Seluruh Bab Kelompok terhadap Target Presentasi
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId1}}/check-completeness
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: m-dafano
x-role: STUDENT

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR G: SKALA KONTRIBUSI RIIL & STATUS KESEIMBANGAN
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6.1 Ambil Rasio Kontribusi Anggota (Deterministik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId2}}/contributions

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### FITUR H & I: AREA GURU (DETEKSI GHOSTING & CATATAN DISKUSI)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7.1 Deteksi Ghosting Room (Akses Murid — Ditolak 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId2}}/alerts
x-role: STUDENT

### 7.2 Deteksi Ghosting Room (Akses Guru — Berhasil mendeteksi Rafi Ahmad)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rooms/{{roomId2}}/alerts
x-user-id: guru-1
x-role: TEACHER

### 7.3 Ringkasan Catatan Otomatis AI untuk Guru (Cache 10 Menit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId2}}/teacher-summary
x-user-id: guru-1
x-role: TEACHER

### 7.4 Transkrip Lengkap Diskusi AI Kelompok
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups/{{groupId2}}/transcript
x-user-id: guru-1
x-role: TEACHER

